# Emptiness: "if {W}{W} was spent" and "if {B}{B} was spent" each need two mana of that color. Paid with a Mox Pearl ({W}), a Mox
# Jet ({B}), a Mox Emerald and Black Lotus's {R}{R}{R}, only one white and one black were spent (the hybrid symbols took one
# each), so neither ability triggers: nobody is asked for a target (! Bot1.Target) although a Llanowar Elves is in the
# graveyard and Bot2's Ornithopter is a legal creature to target. The Elves stay, the Ornithopter lives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Emptiness
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves; Island)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Emptiness.Cast
! Bot1.Target
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Emptiness
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus; Faithless Looting; Island; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Emptiness.Toughness = 5
